Little $uzie Apartment Tokyo
The only physical store in Tokyo. Asymmetric cuts, layering and earthy tones.
https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfLx7nju5RZ/
(approximate location)</description><Point><coordinates>139.7085,35.648,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>FULLMARKS (Ebisu, Nordic outdoor brands)</name><description>Fashion &amp; Outlets
FULLMARKS 恵比寿
Outdoor select shop with top Nordic brands such as Norrøna and Houdini.
https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfLx7nju5RZ/
(approximate location)</description><Point><coordinates>139.712,35.647,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Omotesando / Harajuku shopping route (7 shops)</name><description>Fashion &amp; Outlets
表参道 精選7間
Seven shops you can walk between in an afternoon: sneakers, Japanese fashion, sweets, souvenirs and character goods.
https://www.instagram.com/p/DeMYx8lA6Ub/
(approximate location)</description><Point><coordinates>139.709,35.667,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Ginza Itoya (stationery)</name><description>Stationery, Lifestyle &amp; Characters
銀座 伊東屋
A multi-floor stationery heaven in Ginza.
https://www.instagram.com/p/DYjrjxjvIa_/</description><Point><coordinates>139.767181,35.673069,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Toei Animation store, Ikebukuro (Ojamajo Doremi)</name><description>Stationery, Lifestyle &amp; Characters
東映アニメーション オフィシャルストア 池袋
Official Toei Animation goods shop. A big Ojamajo Doremi section; a must for magical-girl fans.
https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dd01iYSoC_M/
(approximate location)</description><Point><coordinates>139.719,35.7295,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
