かっぱ橋道具街
Tokyo&#x27;s biggest kitchenware and tableware wholesale district, between Ueno and Asakusa. The poster offers a list of 10 good shops by DM (comment 「餐具」).
https://www.instagram.com/reel/DaxOkXegpci/
(approximate location)</description><Point><coordinates>139.7884,35.714,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
