<Folder><name>Souvenirs &amp; To Buy</name>
<Placemark><name>Kayanoya dashi (soup stock packs)</name><description>Food Souvenirs
茅乃舍 だし
&quot;The god of dashi.&quot; The vegetable dashi makes instant tasty noodles; also try the sesame-hotpot, chicken, winter oden, Korean tofu-pot and tamagoyaki bases. Another post asking which flavour to buy: https://www.threads.com/@china.antique/post/DfWd5VejW_c
https://www.threads.com/@liontravel.jp/post/DfR1ZxOgTUe</description><Point><coordinates>139.774048,35.686451,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>New Tokyo Station souvenirs</name><description>Food Souvenirs
東京駅 伴手禮
Newer, tasty souvenirs at Tokyo Station, beyond Shiroi Koibito. The shop list is in the video; the poster DMs it if you comment 「伴手禮」.
https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dc3H7HRiYYR/
(approximate location)</description><Point><coordinates>139.768,35.6806,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>Stay</name>
<Placemark><name>Hotel Paul House Okachimachi</name><description>Ueno / Asakusa
HOTEL PAUL HOUSE 御徒町
Japanese-style hotel 2–3 min from the subway, near Ueno, Okachimachi and Akihabara. Rooms for 2 to 4. Taiwanese-run, so staff speak Chinese. Luggage storage after checkout ¥250/day. Book early.
https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdllNFbJeVF/</description><Point><coordinates>139.77858,35.706005,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Onyado Nono Asakusa (Dormy Inn premium)</name><description>Ueno / Asakusa
天然温泉 凌雲の湯 御宿 野乃 浅草
Dormy Inn&#x27;s premium brand with a natural hot spring and a famous breakfast (unlimited salmon roe and scallops). About NT$5,000/night with breakfast; sells out fast in peak season.
https://www.instagram.com/reel/C3P03YhL1A6/</description><Point><coordinates>139.79422,35.715229,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Whole-house rental near Uguisudani (up to 14)</name><description>Ueno / Asakusa
鶯谷 包棟民宿 (@suddenly_japan)
Whole-house rental for groups and families (up to 14 guests). Close to the station, with FamilyMart and a Don Quijote nearby where you can find items sold out elsewhere.
https://www.instagram.com/reel/DaAYc4NRSdM/
(approximate location)</description><Point><coordinates>139.7785,35.721,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>JR Kyushu Hotel Blossom Shinjuku</name><description>Shinjuku / West
JR九州ホテル ブラッサム新宿
Across the road from Shinjuku Station, with Lawson next door. Very convenient for JR and private railways. Tel +81 3-5333-8687.
https://www.instagram.com/reel/DQ6qBXqAf8_/</description><Point><coordinates>139.698364,35.687759,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>UNITO Takadanobaba (apartment-style)</name><description>Shinjuku / West
UNITO 高田馬場
Budget apartment hotel on the Yamanote Line for 1–5 people (2-night minimum). Living room, kitchen and washing machine; the sofa becomes a double bed. Convenience store downstairs, Don Quijote nearby. Also branches in Shinjuku, Kamata and Waseda.
https://www.instagram.com/reel/Deg-FQABl9B/
(approximate location)</description><Point><coordinates>139.7038,35.7128,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Recommended Shinjuku hotel for shoppers</name><description>Shinjuku / West
新宿飯店
Reel recommending a Shinjuku hotel for shopping trips. The name is only in the video.
https://www.instagram.com/reel/DbdGTz6AjvW/
(approximate location)</description><Point><coordinates>139.703,35.693,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Shizutetsu Hotel Prezio Tokyo Tamachi</name><description>Tokyo Station / South
静鉄ホテルプレジオ東京田町
7 min walk from Tamachi Station, 4 stops to Tokyo Station, near Tokyo Tower. Lawson, FamilyMart, 7-Eleven and a big Life supermarket nearby. Daily cleaning, washing machine, microwave and ice machine.
https://www.instagram.com/reel/Cz3dIY3L74Q/
(approximate location)</description><Point><coordinates>139.748,35.6455,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Narita Tobu Hotel Airport</name><description>Narita Airport
成田東武ホテルエアポート
Good for awkward flight times. Free airport shuttle, and a shuttle to the old Naritasan Omotesando street (&quot;Little Kyoto&quot;).
https://www.instagram.com/reel/DIY2vfdSkvj/</description><Point><coordinates>140.379913,35.780506,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
