<Folder><name>Sightseeing &amp; Events</name>
<Placemark><name>Roppongi Hills Christmas illumination &amp; German market</name><description>Seasonal: Christmas &amp; Autumn
六本木ヒルズ クリスマス
400 m &quot;SNOW &amp; BLUE&quot; illumination on Keyakizaka. Shoot the lights with Tokyo Tower from near Emporio Armani. The German Christmas market is in its 20th year: mulled wine and sausages.
https://www.instagram.com/p/DeVwDx3ko6a/</description><Point><coordinates>139.729,35.6595,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
